            "qa": [
              {
                "title": "Q865 (Aug. 8, 2024)",
                "question": "If this follower's Last Words ability triggers, and I have no copies of Colosseum on High in my deck, do I still have to search my deck?",
                "answer": "Yes. After looking through your deck, you would shuffle it without summoning a Colosseum on High."
              },
              {
                "title": "Q864 (Aug. 8, 2024)",
                "question": "If I play this follower's Fanfare ability, which player goes first?",
                "answer": "The active player does. When multiple players need to make a selection, the active player will go first. In this case, the order will be as follows:\n\n1. The active player buries each follower on their field except for one of their choice.\n2. The next non-active player buries each follower on their field except for one of their choice. This continues until each player has resolved this follower's Fanfare ability."
              },
              {
                "title": "Q863 (Aug. 8, 2024)",
                "question": "If an opponent only has 2 Heavenly Aegises on their field, can this follower's Fanfare ability cause them to bury 1 of them?",
                "answer": "Yes. Heavenly Aegis's \"This follower can't be destroyed by abilities\" does not trigger because burying a card isn't the same as destroying it."
              }
            ],
