                "raw_text": "{icon_fanfare|[fanfare]} Each player looks at the top 3 cards of their deck. They may summon a follower from among them. They bury the rest.\nWhile this card is on the field, if a follower on the field can attack a follower, it can't attack leaders.",
                "speech": null,
                "illustrator": "Josh Hutchinson",
                "image": "/wordpress/wp-content/images/cardlist/BP06/BP06-109EN.png",
                "trait_raw": "Arena",
